# Provider schema sources

You can verify each source hash in sources.json. Runtime validation uses these local copies and makes no schema network requests.

- Render: https://render.com/schema/render.yaml.json, retrieved October 9, 2026. This is the schema linked from Render's Blueprint reference.
- DigitalOcean: https://github.com/digitalocean/openapi at c877edaca00c297f539cb4c2f52cacef7a7f6990, Apache 2.0 (LICENSE.digitalocean). The App Spec and its 47 referenced OpenAPI models are bundled into local JSON Schema definitions. Relative references are rewritten; nullable scalar types become JSON Schema unions with null. Other source constraints are preserved.

Generated documents also pass Forge's capability checks before schema validation. The schema does not prove access to a cloud account or that a deployment became healthy.
